text Naranja_IslaTrovita_G00_M03_Text_0816689D {
    "The DEVON CORPORATION...\nWe all just shorten it to DEVON.\pThat company makes all sorts of\nconvenient products."
}

text Naranja_IslaTrovita_G00_M03_Text_0816690C {
    "Hm? A sneaky-looking man?\pCome to think of it, yes, a shady-\nlooking guy went around the corner."
}

text Naranja_IslaTrovita_G00_M03_Text_0816696D {
    "Have you taken the POKéMON GYM\nchallenge?\pWhen you get that shiny GYM BADGE\nin hand, I guess TRAINERS begin to\lrealize what is required of them."
}

text Naranja_IslaTrovita_G00_M03_Text_081669FE {
    "Hey, that’s RUSTBORO’s GYM BADGE!\pOut of all the POKéMON GYM BADGES,\nRUSTBORO’s is the coolest, I’d say."
}

text Naranja_IslaTrovita_G00_M03_Text_08166A67 {
    "Oh? Who might you be?\nYou’re a new face around these parts.\pHave you just transferred into the\nPOKéMON TRAINER’S SCHOOL?"
}

text Naranja_IslaTrovita_G00_M03_Text_08166AE0 {
    "I challenged the GYM LEADER, but...\pIt’s not going to be easy winning with\nmy FIRE-type POKéMON...\pFIRE-type POKéMON don’t match up\nwell against ROCK-type POKéMON..."
}

text Naranja_IslaTrovita_G00_M03_Text_08166B86 {
    "The old sailor MR. BRINEY lives in a\ncottage by the sea.\pHe goes for walks in the tunnel every\nso often."
}

text Naranja_IslaTrovita_G00_M03_Text_08166BEF {
    "The old sailor MR. BRINEY lives in a\ncottage by the sea.\pHe said he was going shopping in\nSLATEPORT for his pet, PEEKO.\pThat old seadog, he must really love\nthat PEEKO."
}

text Naranja_IslaTrovita_G00_M03_Text_08166C98 {
    "Wow, you have POKéMON with you, too.\pWhen I get bigger, I’m going to go\nplaces with POKéMON, too."
}

text Naranja_IslaTrovita_G00_M03_Text_08166CFA {
    "POKéMON TRAINER’S SCHOOL!\pIf I go to this school, will I be able\nto catch rare POKéMON easily?"
}

text Naranja_IslaTrovita_G00_M03_Text_08166D59 {
    "If a POKéMON gains experience in\nbattles, it can sometimes change in\lthe way it looks."
}

text Naranja_IslaTrovita_G00_M03_Text_08166DB0 {
    "A POKéMON changes shape?\nIf one did that, I would be shocked!"
}

text Naranja_IslaTrovita_G00_M03_Text_08166DEE {
    "A POKéMON you get in a trade from\nsomeone grows fast.\pBut if you don’t have certain GYM\nBADGES, it may not obey you..."
}

text Naranja_IslaTrovita_G00_M03_Text_08166EA5 {
    "Ñラùù\nùùヨメùùù\nÑÈカ\nÎÎÎÎÎÎù\nÌÌÌÌÌÌÌ\n¡No te vayas todavìa!\pQuedaste conmigo en que ayudarìas\na mi hermanito encontrando el Onix.\pVen a nuestra y ofrécele tu ayuda.\p¡Eso le animará muchìsimo!\p¡Arreando!"
}

text Naranja_IslaTrovita_G00_M03_Text_08166FB4 {
    "Sto. MARA: ¿{PLAYER}?\p¡Ah!\pMi prima de Isla VALENCIA\nme habló de tì.\pPor lo visto liaste una buena\nestrellándote con un Zépelin.\p…remolinos…\pCúrate con esto."
}

text Naranja_IslaTrovita_G00_M03_Text_0816704C {
    "Vaya… tú mochila esta llena. \nNo podrás guardarlo."
}

text Naranja_IslaTrovita_G00_M03_Text_0816707F {
    "Bueno… ven por aquì.\n¡Te enseñaré algo!"
}

text Naranja_IslaTrovita_G00_M03_Text_081670A7 {
    "MAY: Oh, hi, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\nHow’s your POKéDEX coming along?\pMine’s looking pretty decent.\pI caught POKéMON in PETALBURG WOODS\nuntil I ran out of POKé BALLS."
}

text Naranja_IslaTrovita_G00_M03_Text_0816713C {
    "MAY: Oh, by the way, I passed MR. BRINEY\nin PETALBURG WOODS.\pI guess he’s on his way home to his\ncottage by the sea.\p{PLAYER}{KUN}, you just moved here so you\nmight not know this, but MR. BRINEY\lwas once a revered seafarer."
}

text Naranja_IslaTrovita_G00_M03_Text_08167213 {
    "BRENDAN: {PLAYER}, how’s your POKéDEX?\nHave you filled in any pages yet?\pMine rules.\pI went on a POKéMON-catching frenzy\nin PETALBURG WOODS until I ran out\lof POKé BALLS."
}

text Naranja_IslaTrovita_G00_M03_Text_081672B8 {
    "BRENDAN: By the way, I walked by MR.\nBRINEY in PETALBURG WOODS.\pI bet he was on his way home to his\ncottage by the sea.\pI bet you didn’t know this, but he’s\nalways got a POKéMON with him."
}

text Naranja_IslaTrovita_G00_M03_Text_08167374 {
    "“Timesaving tunnel nearing\ncompletion!”\p...Is what it says on the sign, but\nthere’s also a big “X” splashed\lacross it in red paint..."
}

text Naranja_IslaTrovita_G00_M03_Text_081673FA {
    "DEVON CORPORATION\p“For all your living needs, we make\nit all.”"
}

text Naranja_IslaTrovita_G00_M03_Text_08167439 {
    "RUSTBORO CITY POKéMON GYM\nLEADER: ROXANNE\p“The ROCK-loving honors student!”"
}

text Naranja_IslaTrovita_G00_M03_Text_081674DD {
    "RUSTBORO CITY\p“The city probing the integration of\nnature and science.”"
}

text Naranja_IslaTrovita_G00_M03_Text_08167525 {
    "POKéMON TRAINER’S SCHOOL\p“We’ll teach you anything about\nPOKéMON!”"
}

text Naranja_IslaTrovita_G00_M03_Text_08167568 {
    "CUTTER’S HOUSE"
}
